FFmpeg x64 Build Steps
1. Environment Setup
Install MSYS2

Open MSYS2 MinGW64 shell (mandatory)

Update packages:

pacman -Syu

restart shell if prompted

pacman -Syu

2. Install Dependencies
pacman -S --needed \
mingw-w64-x86_64-toolchain \
mingw-w64-x86_64-nasm \
mingw-w64-x86_64-yasm \
mingw-w64-x86_64-cmake \
git make pkg-config

3. Fetch FFmpeg Source
cd ~
git clone https://git.ffmpeg.org/ffmpeg.git
cd ffmpeg
git checkout n6.1

4. Configure (x64)
Static build

./configure \
--prefix=/mingw64 \
--arch=x86_64 \
--target-os=mingw32 \
--enable-gpl \
--enable-version3 \
--enable-static \
--disable-shared \
--disable-debug

OR Shared (DLL) build

./configure \
--prefix=/mingw64 \
--arch=x86_64 \
--target-os=mingw32 \
--enable-gpl \
--enable-version3 \
--enable-shared \
--disable-static \
--disable-debug

5. Compile
make -j$(nproc)

6. Install
make install

Artifacts installed to:

/mingw64/bin
/mingw64/lib
/mingw64/include

7. Verification
ffmpeg -version

ffmpeg -buildconf
